            "review_text": "Bao Anh Tran\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam15 contributions\n0\nHidden gem in town, best place for occassional dinner to me!\nFeb 2026 • Couples\nWe visited Nephele to celebrate our wedding anniversary and had an amazing dining experience. Too lazy but still think they deserve a detailed review, they should be much more well known.\n\nThe evening started at the ground floor with three starters, a very welcoming way to begin the meal. Cozy vibe. Then we moved upstairs for the next courses. It was my first time trying dairy cattle sweetbread, and I was really impressed by how Chef Francis balanced the flavors so well without it feeling heavy. The sourdough was also on another level. We met Paul, he suggested some pairings during dinner, unique wines based on our preferences that matched the dishes perfectly. Impressed by his knowledge of wines.\n\nEvery dish was beautifully executed, especially the sauces and garnishes. The apple pie dessert was also a highlight for me, the mix of cold, hot, and sweet elements was just perfect.\n\nAfter dinner we went down to Ethereal Bar for mignardises and cocktails, and it was lovely chatting with the team. Everyone is so attentive and accommodating. We had plenty of space to enjoy our own convo, yet the team was always attentive and never made us feel overlooked.\n\nA wonderful place for a special occasion. Definitely come back next time. Highly recommended 👍🏻\nRead more\nWritten April 1, 2026",
