            "review_text": "Hank Nguyen\n9 contributions\n0\nA wonderful experience\nNov 2024 • Couples\nWe had our anniversary dinner here and had an amazing time. The staff was attentive and professional the whole time, walking us through diffent settings within the restaurant to let us enjoy the cozy and romatic atmosphere. The dishes were meticulously crafted, and obviously prepared with passion, all working together in harmony to create a magical dining journey. However, the pigeon really stood out as the highlight of the evening. To top it off, they even had a surprise for us towards the end! All in all it was a delightful experience and we'll definitely come back soon.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 11, 2025",
