            "review_text": "Eric J\nGrasse, France14 contributions\n0\nFusion kitchen to discover\nJul 2025 • Friends\nAn exceptional culinary experience 😍 first we install you in a lounge at the entrance (ground floor) for a first tasting of appetizers (3) accompanied by an exceptional and well chosen Pouilly Fuissé by our host, very professional and inexhaustible on the subject. Then we go upstairs to go to the table. We discover the kitchen open, directed, serenely and in silence 😉 by Chef Francis, a real artist who is about to make us discover his Fusion cuisine, the Journey continues 😁. The dishes follow one another, I don't remember much the descriptions but I suggest you discover the photos that speak for themselves. Note the ice cream. Overlaid with caviar, or pigeon thigh, the plate with its slice of bread and its square of honey directly from the hive, the oyster sauce, beef tartare or foie gras... In fact it is the associations created by Chef Francis that create the surprise 😁 thank you to him for taking the time to exchange a few minutes with us!!\nRead more\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten August 2, 2025",
