            "review_text": "DENIS C\nFontenay-sous-Bois, France1491 contributions\n0\nAbsolutely perfect one star Michelin level\nMar 2025 • Friends\nExcellent discovery this gem opened only 6 months ago , very innovative fusion cuisine dégustation menu is a must. , perfect wine pairing , the pigeon was cooked to perfection, from the amuse bouche to the dessert everything is a festival of savour, attentive service , nice cozy atmosphere \nReservation recommended. A bit pricy but with every dong. I will go back for sure\nRead more\nWritten March 6, 2025\nNephele Restaurant\nDear sir, \n\nThank you for such a glowing and detailed review! \n\nIt brings us immense joy to know that Nephele has left such lasting impression in you. Chef Francis Tran and our team strive to create not just exceptional dishes but also an unforgettable culinary journey from start to finish, and we are truly delighted to hear you enjoyed your Nephele experience.\n\nWe are looking forward to welcoming you back!\n\nAll the best,\nNephele Restaurant\nRead more\nWritten March 10, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
